<h2 id="step-8%3A-build-a-complete-theme" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#step-8%3A-build-a-complete-theme">#</a> Step 8: Build a Complete Theme</h2>
<p>Create a custom theme from scratch.</p>
<h3 id="theme-structure" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#theme-structure">#</a> Theme Structure</h3>
<pre><code>my-custom-theme/
├── package.json
├── src/
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── Header.marko
│   │   └── Footer.marko
│   ├── layouts/
│   │   └── default.marko
│   └── styles.css
└── index.ts
</code></pre>
<h3 id="package.json" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#package.json">#</a> Package.json</h3>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "name"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#032F62">"@username/theme-custom"</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "version"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#032F62">"1.0.0"</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "main"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#032F62">"index.ts"</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">  "peerDependencies"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">    "markopress"</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#032F62">"^1.0.0"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">  }</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">}</span></span>
